	(property "Description" "ESP32-S2-MINI-2 and ESP32-S2-MINI-2U are two powerful, generic Wi-Fi MCU modules that have a rich set of peripherals. They are an ideal choice for a wide variety of application scenarios related to Internet of Things (IoT), such as wearable electronics and smart home."
